{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/01d5c92d659e8fcb8ae71d0b2208d99a.avif?t=1768512692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras_big/01d5c92d659e8fcb8ae71d0b2208d99a.avif?t=1768512692 width=800 height=67 /></span>In Poker Warlords, each card dealt spawns a medieval fantasy army! You might get dealt a mighty 10 out of 10 Dragons or a measly 8 out of 40 Footmen. Play traditional poker betting rounds with face-down and face-up cards, then choose which two armies will fight for you in battle. You have to know when to hold 'em and when to fold 'em!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/0a07755fd4eeefe985133603c49b657f.poster.avif?t=1768512692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/0a07755fd4eeefe985133603c49b657f.webm?t=1768512692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/0a07755fd4eeefe985133603c49b657f.mp4?t=1768512692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/ee8cf7ff3c5a0b7f7d5437815a5ff8a1.avif?t=1768512692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras_big/ee8cf7ff3c5a0b7f7d5437815a5ff8a1.avif?t=1768512692 width=800 height=80 /></span>Each hand creates a new opportunity to flex your strategic muscle and gather all the chips into your stack. Raise, Call, or Fold on three-card hands of medieval fantasy armies, weighing the odds based on the type and number of units in hand against each opponent's visible card. <br><br>Poker is a game of deception\u2014and so is war. Go all in or bluff to psych out the competition, or dominate with pure force to claim victory. Poker Warlords takes traditional poker strategy and layers it with a rich combat system, creating a new experience unlike any other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/bfc64fa8f658ca17f7aaa2c18c513c83.poster.avif?t=1768512692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/bfc64fa8f658ca17f7aaa2c18c513c83.webm?t=1768512692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/bfc64fa8f658ca17f7aaa2c18c513c83.mp4?t=1768512692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/ea8dabefea6e878bad02d63f26bc26a9.avif?t=1768512692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras_big/ea8dabefea6e878bad02d63f26bc26a9.avif?t=1768512692 width=800 height=80 /></span>Bet smart, battle hard, then win big! Choose your front line and back line cards then clash your armies in fast-paced autobattler combat. The last unit standing takes the pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/9863833156f06c05175b8588ee8a9955.poster.avif?t=1768512692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/9863833156f06c05175b8588ee8a9955.webm?t=1768512692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/9863833156f06c05175b8588ee8a9955.mp4?t=1768512692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/ded1675abdeb7b85a79f9fe0c6c65825.avif?t=1768512692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras_big/ded1675abdeb7b85a79f9fe0c6c65825.avif?t=1768512692 width=800 height=80 /></span>Earn your place on the leaderboard or enjoy casual games with friends. Unlock rare avatars, customize your experience, and enter high-stakes competitions. Poker Warlords is free-to-play and features no pay-to-win mechanics\u2014just skill, strategy, and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/7eb26881f6713d9e7cb237ecc0e6ce28.avif?t=1768512692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras_big/7eb26881f6713d9e7cb237ecc0e6ce28.avif?t=1768512692 width=800 height=67 /></span>Built by the developers of BattlePoker, a top-10 StarCraft II arcade game, Poker Warlords brings a fresh, competitive twist to both poker and autobattlers. Years of refinement, an innovative blend of strategy, and a passionate community\u2014this is poker like you\u2019ve never played before.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1961710?t=1768512692","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768512692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768512692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768512692","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4099160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/01d5c92d659e8fcb8ae71d0b2208d99a.avif?t=1768512692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras_big/01d5c92d659e8fcb8ae71d0b2208d99a.avif?t=1768512692 width=800 height=67 /></span>In Poker Warlords, each card dealt spawns a medieval fantasy army! You might get dealt a mighty 10 out of 10 Dragons or a measly 8 out of 40 Footmen. Play traditional poker betting rounds with face-down and face-up cards, then choose which two armies will fight for you in battle. You have to know when to hold 'em and when to fold 'em!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/0a07755fd4eeefe985133603c49b657f.poster.avif?t=1768512692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/0a07755fd4eeefe985133603c49b657f.webm?t=1768512692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/0a07755fd4eeefe985133603c49b657f.mp4?t=1768512692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/ee8cf7ff3c5a0b7f7d5437815a5ff8a1.avif?t=1768512692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras_big/ee8cf7ff3c5a0b7f7d5437815a5ff8a1.avif?t=1768512692 width=800 height=80 /></span>Each hand creates a new opportunity to flex your strategic muscle and gather all the chips into your stack. Raise, Call, or Fold on three-card hands of medieval fantasy armies, weighing the odds based on the type and number of units in hand against each opponent's visible card. <br><br>Poker is a game of deception\u2014and so is war. Go all in or bluff to psych out the competition, or dominate with pure force to claim victory. Poker Warlords takes traditional poker strategy and layers it with a rich combat system, creating a new experience unlike any other. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/bfc64fa8f658ca17f7aaa2c18c513c83.poster.avif?t=1768512692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/bfc64fa8f658ca17f7aaa2c18c513c83.webm?t=1768512692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/bfc64fa8f658ca17f7aaa2c18c513c83.mp4?t=1768512692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/ea8dabefea6e878bad02d63f26bc26a9.avif?t=1768512692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras_big/ea8dabefea6e878bad02d63f26bc26a9.avif?t=1768512692 width=800 height=80 /></span>Bet smart, battle hard, then win big! Choose your front line and back line cards then clash your armies in fast-paced autobattler combat. The last unit standing takes the pot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/9863833156f06c05175b8588ee8a9955.poster.avif?t=1768512692\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/9863833156f06c05175b8588ee8a9955.webm?t=1768512692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/9863833156f06c05175b8588ee8a9955.mp4?t=1768512692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/ded1675abdeb7b85a79f9fe0c6c65825.avif?t=1768512692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras_big/ded1675abdeb7b85a79f9fe0c6c65825.avif?t=1768512692 width=800 height=80 /></span>Earn your place on the leaderboard or enjoy casual games with friends. Unlock rare avatars, customize your experience, and enter high-stakes competitions. Poker Warlords is free-to-play and features no pay-to-win mechanics\u2014just skill, strategy, and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras/7eb26881f6713d9e7cb237ecc0e6ce28.avif?t=1768512692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/extras_big/7eb26881f6713d9e7cb237ecc0e6ce28.avif?t=1768512692 width=800 height=67 /></span>Built by the developers of BattlePoker, a top-10 StarCraft II arcade game, Poker Warlords brings a fresh, competitive twist to both poker and autobattlers. Years of refinement, an innovative blend of strategy, and a passionate community\u2014this is poker like you\u2019ve never played before.</p>","developers":["SkeleJelly Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/5274dc8de01f07ac321e00f9f6c1a410d70b4430/header.jpg?t=1768512692","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Linux<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5, 2.4 Ghz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 650+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 980+</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1961710/1680183054/729effc358ebbf89e4d1073efcd7eaa672bb47a0/1763495505/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763496069","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1961710/1680183054/729effc358ebbf89e4d1073efcd7eaa672bb47a0/1763495505/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763496069","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1961710/1680183054/729effc358ebbf89e4d1073efcd7eaa672bb47a0/1763495505/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763496069","id":257234023,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257234023/6c2a14b729a373c36fa76d43450e92d642991478/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763496069"}],"name":"Poker Warlords","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5, 2.4 Ghz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 650+<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 980+</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["SkeleJelly Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cCombining the risk management and social bluffing elements of poker with the build-synergy elements of roguelike deck-builders makes for an unexpectedly compelling combination.\u201d<br><strong>SIX 2025 Reviewer </strong><br><br>\u201cYou still have aspects of hidden information that makes the core concept of Poker work, but there's just enough information you feel like you can maybe make smarter decisions. Incredibly well thought out game!\u201d<br><strong>SIX 2025 Reviewer</strong><br><br>\u201cCard games are not normally my favorite, but after a few minutes of the tutorial I was absolutely hooked.\u201d<br><strong>TooManyGames 2025 \u2014 Nominated for best indie game award</strong><br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/d81dd4a94ff64182f5b429ad0f01e239f4d07aa5/ss_d81dd4a94ff64182f5b429ad0f01e239f4d07aa5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768512692","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/d81dd4a94ff64182f5b429ad0f01e239f4d07aa5/ss_d81dd4a94ff64182f5b429ad0f01e239f4d07aa5.600x338.jpg?t=1768512692"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/ebe98525c86bda2653babea66ca2c4bd50849bc9/ss_ebe98525c86bda2653babea66ca2c4bd50849bc9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768512692","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea