umbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1961710/8b76b18f85172f9fad7a923a2cdbc45800586bff/ss_8b76b18f85172f9fad7a923a2cdbc45800586bff.600x338.jpg?t=1768512692"}],"short_description":"Poker but your cards fight to win the pot. Turn cards into armies, complete combos for more power, and claim victory on the battlefield and at the betting table! From the creators of a top-10 StarCraft II custom game, this is poker like you've never played before.","steam_appid":1961710,"support_info":{"email":"pokerwarlords@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://www.pokerwarlords.com/"}